[Step 4] Partial-fraction decomposition of Delta_n(x) in n
==============================================================================
  Delta_n(x) = -x*(x + 1)*(x**4 - 4*x**3 + 11*x**2 - 10*x + 5)/(n - 1) + x*(2*x - 1)*(2*x + 1)*(2*x**3 - 3*x**2 + 4*x - 1)/(2*(n - 2)) + 3*x*(x**2 - 4*x + 5)/(2*n) - x*(x - 1)/n**2

  apart_list raw structure: (1, Poly(0, n, domain='ZZ[x]'), [(Poly(_w**2 - 3*_w + 2, _w, domain='ZZ[x]'), Lambda(_a, _a*(5*x**6 - 9*x**5 + 14*x**4 + x**3/2 - 7*x**2 + 11*x/2) - 6*x**6 + 12*x**5 - 21*x**4 - 3*x**3/2 + 12*x**2 - 21*x/2), Lambda(_a, -_a + n), 1), (Poly(_w, _w, domain='ZZ[x]'), Lambda(_a, -x**2 + x), Lambda(_a, -_a + n), 2), (Poly(_w, _w, domain='ZZ[x]'), Lambda(_a, 3*x**3/2 - 6*x**2 + 15*x/2), Lambda(_a, -_a + n), 1)])

  Solving for A(x),B(x),C(x),Dd(x) in Delta_n(x)=A/n+B/n^2+C/(n-1)+Dd/(n-2):
    A(x) = 3*x**3/2 - 6*x**2 + 15*x/2
    B(x) = -x**2 + x
    C(x) = -x**6 + 3*x**5 - 7*x**4 - x**3 + 5*x**2 - 5*x
    Dd(x) = 4*x**6 - 6*x**5 + 7*x**4 - x**3/2 - 2*x**2 + x/2
  Reconstruction check (recon - Delta_n(x)): 0 (expect 0)

  A(x)+C(x)+Dd(x) - g3(x) = 0  (expect 0, confirms leading order)
  => n*Delta_n(x) = g3(x) + B(x)/n + C(x)/(n-1) + 2*Dd(x)/(n-2)

  Sign / extremal analysis of B(x), C(x), Dd(x) on [0,1]:
    B(x): min=0 at x=0, max=0.250000000000000 at x=0.5000000000
    C(x): min=-6.00000000000000 at x=1.000000000, max=0 at x=0
    Dd(x): min=-0.0184953641423598 at x=0.4177008742, max=3.00000000000000 at x=1.000000000

